摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"AI-native terminal & SSH client — Harness launches DeepSeek / CodEx / Claude agents on PowerShell 7 in TUI or embedded Web UI, plus SFTP, serial/Telnet and a built-in MCP server.","id":"gh:1331760451","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"lyshell-archive","slug":"liangyou09/lyshell-archive","topics":["agent","ai","ai-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","electron","llm","mcp","model-context-protocol","powershell7","serial-port","sftp","ssh","ssh-client","telnet","terminal","xtermjs"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"AI-native terminal & SSH client — Harness launches DeepSeek / CodEx / Claude agents on PowerShell 7 "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"in TUI or embedded Web UI, plus SFTP, serial/Telnet and a built-in MCP server."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 💻 LyShell"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 🔌 **Your terminal, now AI's terminal too.** LyShell is a Windows terminal with a built-in MCP serv"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"er — letting Claude Code and other AI clients drive your SSH / Telnet / serial / local PTY sessions "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"directly. Plus AI Harness workspaces with git-worktree isolation (TUI + embedded Web UI), in-app web"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" tabs, AI Agent launcher, plugin system, and Python scripting."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"✨ Highlights · 🐋 DeepSeek Harness · 🌐 Web Tabs · 🔗 MCP · 🤖 AI Agents · 🧩 Plugins · 🚀 Quick Start · ❓"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ghlights · 🐋 DeepSeek Harness · 🌐 Web Tabs · 🔗 MCP · 🤖 AI Agents · 🧩 Plugins · 🚀 Quick Start · ❓ FAQ"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Highlights"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| 🔗 **MCP Server** — Expose your terminals to Claude Code and other AI clients, with per-session aut"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"horization and audit log | 🤖 **Agent Launcher** — Run Claude Code, Aider, Copilot CLI, or any custom"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" CLI in a clean transient terminal |\n| 🧩 **Plugin System** — Extend with Python or Node.js plugins, "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"each running under granular permissions | 🐍 **Python Engine** — Script terminal automation through a"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" built-in `LyShell` API |\n| 🐋 **DeepSeek Harness** — Manage workspaces with variable sets & model pr"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"esets, launch TUI and embedded Web UI side by side | 🔐 **Embedded Web UI** — Run `dsh web` in an in-"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"app `<webview>` tab, loopback-locked and URL-validated |\n| 🌳 **Worktree isolation** — Launch each Ha"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"rness workspace in its own git worktree, so multiple agents on one repo never stomp each other | 🌐 *"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"*Web tabs** — Open any URL as an in-app tab, with recent-access history and autocomplete |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 📥 Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Download the latest portable build from Releases — **no installation needed**, just download and run"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ownload the latest portable build from Releases — **no installation needed**, just download and run."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Platform | Format | Architecture | Requirements |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 🪟 Windows | Portable (.exe) | x64 | Windows 10 / 11, 64-bit |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> 🚧 Currently **Windows only** — macOS and Linux builds are not yet available."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 🔗 MCP Integration"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**This is what makes LyShell different.** It serves as an MCP server, letting external AI clients li"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ke Claude Code control terminals via the MCP protocol — listing sessions, sending commands, reading "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"output, transferring files, and managing connections."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> 📖 **Configuration** — see MCP Configuration. In most cases you don't configure anything by hand: l"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"aunch an agent from the **Agent Launcher** and ask it to configure LyShell as its MCP server itself."},{"id":"p15s3","text":" Registration configs are emitted in **JSON / CLI / TOML** to fit different clients."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Tools"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Tool | Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `list_sessions` | `read` | List sidebar sessions |\n| `send_input` | `interactiveWrite` | Send text"},{"id":"p18s2","text":", autoNewline support |\n| `send_and_wait` | `interactiveWrite` | Send and capture response, strips e"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"cho + ANSI |\n| `execute_command` | `execute` / `localExecute` | Run via independent exec channel (SS"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"H only) |\n| `run_on_sessions` | `execute` / `localExecute` | Broadcast command, max 50 sessions, con"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"currency 10 |\n| `read_output` | `read` | Read N lines of terminal output |\n| `upload_file` / `downlo"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ad_file` | `fileWrite` | SFTP file transfer |\n| `read_file` / `stat_file` / `list_files` | `read` | "},{"id":"p18s7","text":"Remote file inspection, recursive + glob |\n| `create_session` | `sessionControl` | Create/reuse save"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"d session, auto-dedup by target |\n| `reconnect_session` | `sessionControl` | Reconnect dropped conne"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"ction |\n| `close_session` | `sessionControl` | Disconnect without deleting the saved session |\n| `op"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"en_connection_dialog` | `sessionControl` | Open the new-connection dialog for user input |\n| `read_s"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"ession_notes` | `read` | Read session summary, notes, tags |\n| `write_session_notes` | `sessionMetad"},{"id":"p18s12","text":"ataWrite` | Update summary, notes, tags |\n| `wait_for_prompt` | `read` | Wait for shell prompt or re"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"gex |\n| `tail_until` | `read` | Poll output until pattern matches |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Security"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- 🔑 **Per-session authorization** — each terminal gets its own scoped permission\n- 🚪 **Capability ga"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"tes** — enforced server-side on every endpoint\n- 🛡️ **Destructive-command check** — scans for `rm -r"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"f`, `dd if=`, fork bombs\n- 🔒 **Shared PTY locking** — MCP vs human input never collide\n- 📊 **Audit p"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"anel** — calendar + filter + pagination, accessible from the title bar"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> ⚠️ Full-screen TUI apps (vim, htop, less) are not supported over MCP — ANSI stripping garbles alte"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"rnate-screen sequences. Use the LyShell UI native terminal instead."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 🤖 AI Agents"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Agent-agnostic terminal — no lock-in to any AI tool. Launch any CLI agent and it runs in a regular t"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"erminal with full scrollback, split panes, and IME support."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Agent | Command |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| 🧠 Claude Code | `claude` |\n| 🛠️ OpenAI Codex | `codex` |\n| 🤝 Aider | `aider` |\n| 🐙 Copilot CLI | `"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"de | `claude` |\n| 🛠️ OpenAI Codex | `codex` |\n| 🤝 Aider | `aider` |\n| 🐙 Copilot CLI | `gh copilot` |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**First-class Harness agents** — `dsh`, `codex`, and `claude` are first-class in the Harness panel: "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"each gets its own left-rail tab, a dedicated workspace list, dependency detection, and per-workspace"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" model & environment variables (model passed as `--model`, with `OPENAI_API_KEY` / `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_T"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"OKEN` defaults). Claude workspaces add an optional **skip-permissions** switch (launches with `--dan"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"gerously-skip-permissions`), and any workspace can opt into **worktree isolation** — see DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ly-skip-permissions`), and any workspace can opt into **worktree isolation** — see DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Custom agents**: Any CLI tool can be registered — name, command, icon, working directory, env vars"},{"id":"p27s2","text":". Sessions are transient: close the tab, it's gone."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 🐋 DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Dependency detection & install"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Security"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- 🔒 **Loopback-locked** — navigation and popups are pinned to the workspace's loopback origin.\n- ✅ *"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"*Validated URL** — the echoed URL is checked (loopback + explicit port, no embedded credentials) *be"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"fore* the `<webview>` ever loads it."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
